      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "Localizing and metering amidite delivery is mediated by a computer command",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "hybridization arrays or microfluidic arrays, are sure to play a signif-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "file that directs delivery of the four amidites during each pass of the piezo-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "icant role.",
