      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "system to develop general strategies for designing and optimizing",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
      "text": "DNA array probe design was aimed at discriminating the seven polymor-",
